 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"1795679551:pwOM/QJPUc6o+6Tuegt5Gf/DaCrjIwwW60kn5+8l2ZA=\">\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112514'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>题解：P1059 [NOIP 2006 普及组] 明明的随机数 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"6t0wrb4o\",\"title\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1aP1059 [NOIP 2006 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u660e\\u660e\\u7684\\u968f\\u673a\\u6570\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1754658883,\"author\":{\"uid\":1288325,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/banned.png\",\"name\":\"#SUSPENDED#\",\"slogan\":null,\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":true,\"color\":\"Gray\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":null},\"upvote\":0,\"replyCount\":0,\"favorCount\":0,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1059\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 2006 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u660e\\u660e\\u7684\\u968f\\u673a\\u6570\",\"difficulty\":2,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":3,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"~~\\u7ec8\\u4e8e\\u627e\\u5230\\u4e00\\u7bc7\\u80fd\\u53d1\\u9898\\u89e3\\u7684\\u9898\\u76ee\\u4e86\\uff0c\\u6765\\u6c34\\u4e2a\\u9898\\u89e3~~\\n\\n### First.\\u8bfb\\u9898\\n\\n\\u7b80\\u5316\\u9898\\u610f\\uff1a\\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u957f\\u5ea6\\u4e3an\\u7684\\u5e8f\\u5217a\\uff0c\\u8bf7\\u53bb\\u91cd\\u540e\\u4ece\\u5c0f\\u5230\\u5927\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u3002\\n\\n### Second.\\u601d\\u8003\\n\\n\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u6211\\u4eec\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u601d\\u8003\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\uff0c\\u53bb\\u91cd\\u5e94\\u8be5\\u600e\\u4e48\\u641e\\u3002\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u5e94\\u8be5\\u5f88\\u5feb\\u5c31\\u80fd\\u60f3\\u5230\\u4e00\\u79cd\\u65b9\\u6cd5\\uff1a\\u6392\\u5e8f\\u3002\\n\\n\\u6709\\u7684\\u4eba\\u5c31\\u4f1a\\u60f3\\uff08\\u6bd4\\u5982\\u8bf4\\u6211\\u7684\\u540c\\u5b66\\uff09\\uff1a\\u6392\\u5e8f\\u548c\\u53bb\\u91cd\\u662f\\u600e\\u4e48\\u626f\\u4e0a\\u5173\\u7cfb\\u7684\\uff1f\\n\\n\\u5f88\\u7b80\\u5355\\u3002\\u4f60\\u4eec\\u60f3\\u4e00\\u60f3\\uff0ca\\u6570\\u7ec4\\u6392\\u5e8f\\u4e4b\\u540e\\u662f\\u4e0d\\u662f\\u76f8\\u540c\\u7684\\u6570\\u90fd\\u5728\\u4e00\\u8d77\\u4e86\\uff1f\\u90a3\\u8fd9\\u5c31\\u5f88\\u597d\\u89e3\\u51b3\\u4e86\\u561b\\u3002\\u4ece\\u5934\\u5230\\u5c3e\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u6392\\uff0c\\u5982\\u679c\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u6570\\u548c\\u4e0a\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u6570\\u4e0d\\u4e00\\u6837\\uff0c\\u5c31\\u628a\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u6570\\u5b58\\u5230b\\u6570\\u7ec4\\u91cc\\u3002\\n\\n\\u5f53\\u7136\\uff0c\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u53bb\\u91cd\\u540e\\u7684\\u957f\\u5ea6\\u5c31\\u662fb\\u6570\\u7ec4\\u7684\\u6700\\u5927\\u4e0b\\u6807\\u3002\\n\\n\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u672c\\u4eba\\u5efa\\u8bae\\u4ece\\u5c0f\\u5230\\u5927\\u6392a\\u6570\\u7ec4\\u3002\\u56e0\\u4e3a\\u8fd9\\u6837\\u7684\\u8bdd\\u5c31\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u76f4\\u63a5\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u4e86\\u3002\\n\\n### Third.\\u4ee3\\u7801\\uff08\\u4f60\\u4eec\\u6700\\u559c\\u6b22\\u7684\\u90e8\\u5206\\uff09\\n\\n```cpp\\n#include\\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\ntypedef long long ll;\\nconst int N = 1e6+5;\\/\\/\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u6309\\u5b9e\\u9645\\u7684\\u6570\\u636e\\u8303\\u56f4\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u8c03\\u6574 \\nint ans;\\nint n,a[N],b[N];\\nint main(){\\n\\tcin\\u003E\\u003En;\\/\\/scanf(\\u0022%d\\u0022,\\u0026n);\\n\\tfor(int i=1;i\\u003C=n;i++){\\n\\t\\tcin\\u003E\\u003Ea[i];\\/\\/scanf(\\u0022%d\\u0022,\\u0026a[i]);\\n\\t}\\n\\tsort(a+1,a+1+n);\\/\\/sort\\u9ed8\\u8ba4\\u4ece\\u5c0f\\u5230\\u5927\\u6392\\u5e8f \\n\\tfor(int i=1;i\\u003C=n;i++){\\/\\/\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u4e0b\\u6807\\u6700\\u597d\\u4ece1\\u5f00\\u59cb\\u3002\\u4ece0\\u5f00\\u59cb\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u4f1a\\u8d8a\\u754c \\n\\t\\tif(a[i]!=a[i-1]){\\n\\t\\t\\tb[++j]=a[i];\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n\\tcout\\u003C\\u003Cj\\u003C\\u003C\\u0022\\\\n\\u0022;\\/\\/printf(\\u0022%d\\\\n\\u0022,j);\\n\\tfor(int i=1;i\\u003C=j;i++){\\n\\t\\tcout\\u003C\\u003Cb[i]\\u003C\\u003C\\u0022 \\u0022;\\/\\/printf(\\u0022%d \\u0022,b[i]);\\n\\t}\\n\\treturn 0;\\n}\\n\\n```\\n\\n[AC\\u8bb0\\u5f55](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.com.cn\\/record\\/229720713)\\n\\n\\u672c\\u4eba\\u7684\\u7b2c\\u4e00\\u7bc7\\u9898\\u89e3\\u3002~~\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u5458\\u5927\\u5927\\u6c42\\u8fc7~~\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795593151.716704}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/6t0wrb4o\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1aP1059 [NOIP 2006 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u660e\\u660e\\u7684\\u968f\\u673a\\u6570\",\"description\":\"\\u7ec8\\u4e8e\\u627e\\u5230\\u4e00\\u7bc7\\u80fd\\u53d1\\u9898\\u89e3\\u7684\\u9898\\u76ee\\u4e86\\uff0c\\u6765\\u6c34\\u4e2a\\u9898\\u89e3\\nFirst.\\u8bfb\\u9898\\n\\u7b80\\u5316\\u9898\\u610f\\uff1a\\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u957f\\u5ea6\\u4e3an\\u7684\\u5e8f\\u5217a\\uff0c\\u8bf7\\u53bb\\u91cd\\u540e\\u4ece\\u5c0f\\u5230\\u5927\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u3002\\nSecond.\\u601d\\u8003\\n\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u6211\\u4eec\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u601d\\u8003\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\uff0c\\u53bb\\u91cd\\u5e94\\u8be5\\u600e\\u4e48\\u641e\\u3002\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u5e94\\u8be5\\u5f88\\u5feb\\u5c31\\u80fd\\u60f3\\u5230\\u4e00\\u79cd\\u65b9\\u6cd5\\uff1a\\u6392\\u5e8f\\u3002\\n\\u6709\\u7684\\u4eba\\u5c31\\u4f1a\\u60f3\\uff08\\u6bd4\\u5982\\u8bf4\\u6211\\u7684\\u540c\\u5b66\\uff09\\uff1a\\u6392\\u5e8f\\u548c\\u53bb\\u91cd\\u662f\\u600e\\u4e48\\u626f\\u4e0a\\u5173\\u7cfb\\u7684\\uff1f\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Aairist\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-08-08T21:14:43+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解：P1059 [NOIP 2006 普及组] 明明的随机数\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"终于找到一篇能发题解的题目了，来水个题解\nFirst.读题\n简化题意：给定一个长度为n的序列a，请去重后从小到大输出。\nSecond.思考\n这里我们可以思考一下，去重应该怎么搞。这里应该很快就能想到一种方法：排序。\n有的人就会想（比如说我的同学）：排序和去重是怎么扯上关系的？…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"Aairist\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-08-08T21:14:43+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/6t0wrb4o\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解：P1059 [NOIP 2006 普及组] 明明的随机数</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">Aairist</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-08-08T21:14:43+08:00\">2025-08-08 21:14:43</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p><del>终于找到一篇能发题解的题目了，来水个题解</del></p>\n<h3>First.读题</h3>\n<p>简化题意：给定一个长度为n的序列a，请去重后从小到大输出。</p>\n<h3>Second.思考</h3>\n<p>这里我们可以思考一下，去重应该怎么搞。这里应该很快就能想到一种方法：排序。</p>\n<p>有的人就会想（比如说我的同学）：排序和去重是怎么扯上关系的？</p>\n<p>很简单。你们想一想，a数组排序之后是不是相同的数都在一起了？那这就很好解决了嘛。从头到尾一个一个排，如果这个数和上一个数不一样，就把这个数存到b数组里。</p>\n<p>当然，这里去重后的长度就是b数组的最大下标。</p>\n<p>这里本人建议从小到大排a数组。因为这样的话就可以直接输出了。</p>\n<h3>Third.代码（你们最喜欢的部分）</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\ntypedef long long ll;\nconst int N = 1e6+5;//可以按实际的数据范围进行调整 \nint ans;\nint n,a[N],b[N];\nint main(){\n    cin&gt;&gt;n;//scanf(\"%d\",&amp;n);\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++){\n        cin&gt;&gt;a[i];//scanf(\"%d\",&amp;a[i]);\n    }\n    sort(a+1,a+1+n);//sort默认从小到大排序 \n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++){//这里下标最好从1开始。从0开始可能会越界 \n        if(a[i]!=a[i-1]){\n            b[++j]=a[i];\n        }\n    }\n    cout&lt;&lt;j&lt;&lt;\"\\n\";//printf(\"%d\\n\",j);\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=j;i++){\n        cout&lt;&lt;b[i]&lt;&lt;\" \";//printf(\"%d \",b[i]);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>AC记录</p>\n<p>本人的第一篇题解。<del>管理员大大求过</del></p>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a5ff130afd41f7ff',t:'MTc5NTU5MzE1MQ=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a5ff130afd41f7ff',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
